Third-party data
----------------
This product includes GeoLite2 data created by MaxMind, available from https://www.maxmind.com

The GeoLite2 database is used under MaxMind's end user license agreement. The database is
downloaded by the application with the user's own MaxMind license key, refreshed at least every
30 days, and stored locally. No per-connection lookups are sent to MaxMind or any other service.

Third-party software
--------------------
tpt-netguard is built with open-source Rust crates (see Cargo.lock) and the Tauri framework.
Their licenses are included with each crate's source and are summarised in the release notes.
